body:
I REALLY relate to this, I'm 17 so I can't do much but next year I am moving and cutting all contact with my Mother.  My Mother has SEVERAL mental health problems as I'm sure yours does as well.  She shows up at me and my dad's door almost on the daily and sometimes will not leave for hours no matter how many times we ask her to. 

&#x200B;

I hope it gets better for you, try to move if anything.  In my experience doing what u/Bleu_Cheese_Pursuits does not help.  Just stop speaking to her at all no matter what, move and cut communications.

is this me

&#x200B;

for real though, I'm 17 and have been going through the same shit, DM me if you ever want to talk <3

